& [LexicallySeededSemanticGate]
  + [input] is one exact validated lexical request result index derived catalogue admitted fabric and one exact AnchorQuery
  + [seed] is the canonical unique set of every lexical match unit identity
  + [query_contract] requires empty term_set exact seed equality exactly ExactIdentity allowed channel and no continuation
  + [scanner] is the existing unmodified scan_exact_semantic_anchors function
  + [account] requires every seed to appear exactly once as candidate or explicit unknown and forbids exterior result identities
  + [output] preserves ordered seed identities exact AnchorQueryResult fixed non-authority statement and a domain-separated proof digest

  = must: whole-validate lexical and scanner artifacts before output
  = must: preserve scanner eligibility contributions guards boundary account proof omissions and result digest unchanged
  = must: enforce positive maximum match candidate and serialized result bounds under hard caps
  = must: produce equal bytes for equal inputs and reject any whole-replay difference
  - never: turn lexical relevance into semantic eligibility rank truth authority permission safety or effect

& [Acceptance]
  + exact positive and purpose use-case boundary authority lifecycle stale unknown mutation and bound fixtures pass
  + existing lexical lookup source projection scanner and CLI bytes remain unchanged
  + focused debug release Clippy format evidence and attribution gates pass

